  "prefLabel": "Plc 1302.18 Magnetic resonance technologist",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1302.18 “Magnetic resonance technologist” means “magnetic resonance technologist” as defined in RSA 328-J:1, VII, namely “a person who is licensed under this chapter to perform magnetic resonance procedures using magnetic fields and radio frequency signals.”\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Plc 1300) #13701, eff 8-1-23",
